msgctxt "76"
msgid "Hey, uh, Kiryu-san... Do you have a minute?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Oh, not you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I want to be your apprentice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Huh? What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I always wanted to be strong and tough. I've done a ton of\r\n"
"bouncing jobs all over the country so I get to fight people\r\n"
"and test my own strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"So that explains that display back there at the bowling\r\n"
"alley."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Yeah... But I'm not gonna do that anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Make me your apprentice! I wanna retrain myself\r\n"
"under your expert tutelage!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Slow down a second. I don't take on apprentices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Please! I'm beggin' you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What's your name, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Keigo Jinno."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Huh. Well, Jinno, I can't be your master or anything, but I\r\n"
"can tell you somewhere you might be able to find one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Yeah. The Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Underground Coliseum? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"It's like an underground fighting ring. The place is full of\r\n"
"tough guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Never heard of it before, but it sounds perfect for me!\r\n"
"Kiryu-san, will you show me how to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

